      "text": "Fn Req:\n- multiple products with diffrent price and quantites\n- accept different denominations\n- select product-> dispense product-> return change\n- track products and quantities\n- handle multiple transactions, data consistency\n- interface to restock\n- insufficient and out of stock \n",
